lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In order to use any imported modules other than the main one (e.g. BrowserHistory, which is essential to a lot of people's setups), the unpacked Javascript files in `lib/` need to be present in the distributed build. While this is the case in the NPM package, it is not in the Bower package:\n\nGood:\n\n```\nasa@asa-thinkpad:~/src/bower_test$ ls -R node_modules/react-router/lib/\nnode_modules/react-router/lib/:\nAsyncUtils.js      DOMUtils.js     History.js  Location.js       NavigationTypes.js  Route.js               RouteUtils.js             State.js           umd\nBrowserHistory.js  experimental    index.js    MemoryHistory.js  PropTypes.js        RouterContextMixin.js  RoutingUtils.js           TransitionHook.js  URLUtils.js\nDOMHistory.js      HashHistory.js  Link.js     Navigation.js     Redirect.js         Router.js              ScrollManagementMixin.js  Transition.js\n\nnode_modules/react-router/lib/experimental:\nAsyncProps.js\n\nnode_modules/react-router/lib/umd:\nReactRouter.js  ReactRouter.min.js\n```\n\nBad:\n\n```\nasa@asa-thinkpad:~/src/bower_test$ ls -R bower_components/react-router/lib/\nbower_components/react-router/lib/:\numd\n\nbower_components/react-router/lib/umd:\nReactRouter.js  ReactRouter.min.js\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"asazernik","id":1307640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDc2NDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1307640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik","html_url":"https://github.com/asazernik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asazernik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/1710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/1710/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}